.SH NAME
.PP
getStp \- get STP service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]oma.getStp()\f[]
.SH CATEGORY
.PP
Oma
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
This function is used to get STP service(Sequence Time Protocol service) from
target host of sdbcm.
.SH PARAMETERS
.PP
None
.SH RETURN VALUE
.PP
When the function executes successfully, it will return an object of STP.
.PP
When the function fails, an exception will be thrown and an error message will
be printed.
.SH ERRORS
.PP
The common exceptions of \f[C]getStp()\f[] function are as below:
.PP
